<ul>
<li>Revolutionary Flow mode for autonomous coding</li>
<li>Exceptional context awareness across files</li>
<li>Built on familiar VSCode foundation</li>
<li>Multi-file editing capabilities</li>
<li>Terminal integration for complete workflows</li>
<li>Free tier with generous limits</li>
<li>All VSCode extensions compatible</li>
<li>Intuitive command-K interface</li>
<li>Fast and responsive AI responses</li>
<li>Excellent for complex refactoring</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="cons-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg> Disadvantages</h4>
